{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13447","headline":"变律 二 · 苏涣","name":"变律 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"毒蜂成一窠，高挂恶木枝。\n行人百步外，目断魂亦飞。\n长安大道边，挟弹谁家儿。\n右手持金丸，引满无所疑。\n一中纷下来，势若风雨随。\n身如万箭攒，宛转迷所之。\n徒有疾恶心，奈何不知几。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏涣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}